    description: "After PR 5 (WI-fupus), TS/JS static and instance members get distinct ids, and a static method labels its scope `static <name>`. Four callback-scope forms still tie, verified on fixtures only, split only by occurrence order:\n\n1. Callbacks in a getter and the setter of the same name.\n2. Callbacks in two class field initializers.\n3. Callbacks in two `static {}` blocks.\n4. Computed-name methods (`[Symbol.iterator]()`) label nothing and emit no symbol.\n\nNot checked on a real repository. Repros: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr5/fupus/residual_fixtures/."  # 11c4
